                  <code class="mono rounded bg-white/5 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[12px] text-zinc-300">ant_live_</code>），立即保存。
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="card p-5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                  <span class="flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-indigo-400/10 text-sm text-indigo-300">2</span>
