            <div class="code-block mt-6">
              <div class="code-head"><span>最小接入 · 一行 curl 让通知送到所有设备</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyBlock(this)">复制</button></div>
              <div class="code-body">curl -X POST https://你的域名/v1/notify \\
  -H <span class="tk-str">"Authorization: Bearer ant_live_9f3a2c8e…"</span> \\
  -H <span class="tk-str">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \\
