                  <li>· scope：<code class="mono text-[12px] text-blue-300">notify:send</code> 上报 · <code class="mono text-[12px] text-emerald-300">notify:receive</code> 接收 · <code class="mono text-[12px] text-amber-300">devices:read</code> 只读</li>
