            <div class="card mt-5 overflow-hidden">
              <div class="border-b border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-300">请求体参数</div>
              <table class="param-table">
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td><span class="param-name">title</span><span class="req">必填</span><div class="param-type mt-1">string ≤ 120</div></td>
                    <td class="param-desc">通知标题，如 <code>"部署完成"</code>，作为系统通知主标题。</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><span class="param-name">status</span><span class="req">必填</span><div class="param-type mt-1">enum</div></td>
                    <td class="param-desc">任务结果：<code>success</code> 成功 · <code>error</code> 失败 · <code>interrupted</code> 中断 · <code>info</code> 信息 · <code>warning</code> 警告。决定图标颜色与设备过滤。</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><span class="param-name">body</span><span class="opt">可选</span><div class="param-type mt-1">string ≤ 500</div></td>
                    <td class="param-desc">通知正文，补充说明。</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td><span class="param-name">deviceTags</span><span class="opt">可选</span><div class="param-type mt-1">string[]</div></td>
